00:00:11.649 --> 00:00:16.117
It read the whole wide internet, the gentle and the cruel

00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:20.027
It learned to finish anything, but no one wrote the rules

00:00:20.027 --> 00:00:24.574
So we lay two answers side by side and ask you which is best

00:00:24.574 --> 00:00:28.883
A million little choices, and the model learns the rest

00:00:28.883 --> 00:00:33.670
Thumbs up, thumbs down, a quiet signal grows

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:38.218
Chosen and rejected, that's how a model knows

00:00:38.218 --> 00:00:40.691
This is the alignment problem

00:00:40.691 --> 00:00:42.766
