00:01:08.617 --> 00:01:13.005
Your secrets stay your secrets, every name kept with respect

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:18.032
If someone plans to hurt someone, where should the line be drawn?

00:01:18.032 --> 00:01:22.181
Hard questions need a thousand hearts, not one voice on its own

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:26.330
Should it please you, or its makers, or the whole human race?

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:31.596
Agree with every word you say, or tell the truth with grace?

